msgid "Controller Actions"
msgstr "控制动作"

msgid "Turns only the display off while driving. Press again, touch the screen, or go offroad to wake it. Driving controls stay active."
msgstr "行驶时仅关闭屏幕。再次按下、触摸屏幕或停车即可唤醒。驾驶控制保持激活。"

msgid "Arms or disarms Always On Lateral for the current drive and updates the blue AOL border. The AOL master setting is unchanged."
msgstr "为本次驾驶启用或停用常开横向控制（AOL），并更新蓝色 AOL 边框。AOL 主开关设置不变。"

msgid "A lightweight version of Twilsonco's \"Neural Network FeedForward\" controller. Uses the \"look-ahead\" planned lateral jerk logic from the full model to help smoothen steering adjustments in curves, but does not use the full neural network for torque calculation."
msgstr "Twilsonco\"神经网络前馈\"控制器的轻量版。使用完整模型的\"前瞻\"规划横向加加速度逻辑来平滑弯道转向调整，但不使用完整神经网络计算扭矩。"

msgid "Acceleration and braking control changes to fine-tune how openpilot drives."
msgstr "加速与刹车控制调整，用于微调 openpilot 的驾驶表现。"

msgid "Action performed when the \"Distance\" button is pressed for more than 0.5 seconds."
msgstr "长按\"车距\"按键超过 0.5 秒时执行的动作。"

msgid "Action performed when the \"Distance\" button is pressed for more than 2.5 seconds."
msgstr "长按\"车距\"按键超过 2.5 秒时执行的动作。"

msgid "Action performed when the \"Distance\" button is pressed."
msgstr "短按\"车距\"按键时执行的动作。"

msgid "Action performed when the \"LKAS\" button is pressed."
msgstr "按下\"LKAS\"按键时执行的动作。"

msgid "Action performed when the \"Mode\" button is pressed for more than 0.5 seconds. Hyundai CAN-FD only."
msgstr "长按\"模式\"按键超过 0.5 秒时执行的动作。仅限现代 CAN-FD。"

msgid "Action performed when the \"Mode\" button is pressed for more than 2.5 seconds. Hyundai CAN-FD only."
msgstr "长按\"模式\"按键超过 2.5 秒时执行的动作。仅限现代 CAN-FD。"

msgid "Action performed when the \"Mode\" button is pressed. Hyundai CAN-FD only."
msgstr "按下\"模式\"按键时执行的动作。仅限现代 CAN-FD。"

msgid "Action performed when the \"Star\" button is pressed for more than 0.5 seconds. Hyundai CAN-FD only."
msgstr "长按\"星标\"按键超过 0.5 秒时执行的动作。仅限现代 CAN-FD。"

msgid "Action performed when the \"Star\" button is pressed for more than 2.5 seconds. Hyundai CAN-FD only."
msgstr "长按\"星标\"按键超过 2.5 秒时执行的动作。仅限现代 CAN-FD。"

msgid "Action performed when the \"Star\" button is pressed. Hyundai CAN-FD only."
msgstr "按下\"星标\"按键时执行的动作。仅限现代 CAN-FD。"

msgid "Action performed when the cruise control main button is pressed."
msgstr "按下巡航控制主按键时执行的动作。"

msgid "Action performed when the remapped \"Cancel\" button is pressed for more than 0.5 seconds."
msgstr "长按重映射的\"取消\"按键超过 0.5 秒时执行的动作。"

msgid "Action performed when the remapped \"Cancel\" button is pressed for more than 2.5 seconds."
msgstr "长按重映射的\"取消\"按键超过 2.5 秒时执行的动作。"

msgid "Action performed when the remapped \"Cancel\" button is pressed."
msgstr "按下重映射的\"取消\"按键时执行的动作。"

msgid "Add a button to the driving screen to record the display."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上添加一个录制屏幕的按钮。"

msgid "Add extra buffer when stopped behind vehicles in a rainstorm. Increase for more room; decrease for shorter gaps."
msgstr "暴雨中停在车辆后方时增加额外缓冲。调大留出更多空间，调小缩短间距。"

msgid "Add extra buffer when stopped behind vehicles in low visibility. Increase for more room; decrease for shorter gaps."
msgstr "低能见度下停在车辆后方时增加额外缓冲。调大留出更多空间，调小缩短间距。"

msgid "Add extra buffer when stopped behind vehicles in rain. Increase for more room; decrease for shorter gaps."
msgstr "雨天停在车辆后方时增加额外缓冲。调大留出更多空间，调小缩短间距。"

msgid "Add extra buffer when stopped behind vehicles in snow. Increase for more room; decrease for shorter gaps."
msgstr "雪天停在车辆后方时增加额外缓冲。调大留出更多空间，调小缩短间距。"

msgid "Add extra space behind lead vehicles in a rainstorm. Increase for more space; decrease for tighter gaps."
msgstr "暴雨中增加与前车的额外间距。调大留出更多空间，调小拉近距离。"

msgid "Add extra space behind lead vehicles in low visibility. Increase for more space; decrease for tighter gaps."
msgstr "低能见度下增加与前车的额外间距。调大留出更多空间，调小拉近距离。"

msgid "Add extra space behind lead vehicles in rain. Increase for more space; decrease for tighter gaps."
msgstr "雨天增加与前车的额外间距。调大留出更多空间，调小拉近距离。"

msgid "Add extra space behind lead vehicles in snow. Increase for more space; decrease for tighter gaps."
msgstr "雪天增加与前车的额外间距。调大留出更多空间，调小拉近距离。"

msgid "Add extra space when stopped behind vehicles. Increase for more room; decrease for shorter gaps."
msgstr "停在车辆后方时增加额外间距。调大留出更多空间，调小缩短间距。"

msgid "Add trailer weight to vehicle mass for tow-aware gas, brake, and conservative lateral assist. Enter the loaded trailer weight in pounds."
msgstr "将拖车重量计入整车质量，用于拖挂感知的油门、刹车和保守横向辅助。请输入载重后的拖车重量（磅）。"

msgid "Adjust the radar position offset in meters if the radar alignment needs a small correction."
msgstr "若雷达对位需要小幅修正，以米为单位调整雷达位置偏移。"

msgid "Advanced acceleration and braking control changes to fine-tune how openpilot drives."
msgstr "高级加速与刹车控制调整，用于微调 openpilot 的驾驶表现。"

msgid "Advanced steering control changes to fine-tune how openpilot drives."
msgstr "高级转向控制调整，用于微调 openpilot 的驾驶表现。"

msgid "Advanced visual changes to fine-tune how the driving screen looks."
msgstr "高级视觉调整，用于微调驾驶屏幕的外观。"

msgid "Allow an active navigation route to reduce cruise speed for upcoming turns, ramps, and roundabouts."
msgstr "允许当前导航路线为即将到来的转弯、匝道和环岛降低巡航速度。"

msgid "Allow an active navigation route to request low-speed turn desires."
msgstr "允许当前导航路线请求低速转向意图。"

msgid "Allow openpilot to change lanes."
msgstr "允许 openpilot 自动变道。"

msgid "Allow route lane bias only after steering torque confirms the requested direction. It never initiates a lane change by itself."
msgstr "仅在转向扭矩确认所请求的方向后，才允许路线车道偏移。它绝不会自行发起变道。"

msgid "Allows for a temporary shorter follow distance behind lead so that openpilot merges smoothly out of current lane, it will allow car to accelerate as it changes lanes."
msgstr "允许变道时临时缩短与前车的跟车距离，使 openpilot 平顺地驶出当前车道，并允许车辆在变道过程中加速。"

msgid "Also send a real bookmark for confirmed auto-bookmarks so loggerd preserves the route segment. Leave this off unless you specifically want the extra storage usage."
msgstr "为已确认的自动书签同时发送真实书签，以便 loggerd 保留该路线分段。除非确实需要额外存储占用，否则请保持关闭。"

msgid "Ask before changing to a new speed limit. To accept, tap the flashing on-screen widget or press the Cruise Increase button. To deny, press the Cruise Decrease button or ignore the prompt for 30 seconds."
msgstr "切换到新限速前先询问。点按闪烁的屏幕组件或按\"巡航加速\"键接受；按\"巡航减速\"键或忽略提示 30 秒则拒绝。"

msgid "Automatically adjust driving behavior based on real-time weather. Helps maintain comfort and safety in low visibility, rain, or snow."
msgstr "根据实时天气自动调整驾驶行为。有助于在低能见度、雨雪天气中保持舒适与安全。"

msgid "Automatically apply seasonal theme assets during holiday windows. Turn this off to keep your normal theme year-round."
msgstr "在节日期间自动应用季节性主题素材。关闭则全年保持常规主题。"

msgid "Automatically learn the full steering delay. The manual actuator delay is ignored while enabled."
msgstr "自动学习完整转向延迟。启用时手动执行器延迟将被忽略。"

msgid "Automatically save confirmed vision-detected speed limit signs into the speed-limit debug session so they can be imported into the training set later."
msgstr "自动将已确认的视觉检测限速标志保存到限速调试会话，便于之后导入训练集。"

msgid "Automatically slow down for upcoming curves using data learned from your driving style, adapting to curves as you would."
msgstr "使用从你的驾驶风格学习到的数据，自动为即将到来的弯道减速，像你一样适应弯道。"

msgid "Automatically switch to \"Experimental Mode\" when set conditions are met. Allows the model to handle challenging situations with smarter decision making."
msgstr "满足设定条件时自动切换到\"实验模式\"。让模型以更智能的决策应对复杂路况。"

msgid "Blend model-predicted curvature into gentle turns. 0 uses planner curvature only; 1 uses model prediction only."
msgstr "将模型预测曲率混合进缓弯。0 表示仅使用规划器曲率；1 表示仅使用模型预测。"

msgid "Blend model-predicted curvature into tighter turns. 0 uses planner curvature only; 1 uses model prediction only."
msgstr "将模型预测曲率混合进急弯。0 表示仅使用规划器曲率；1 表示仅使用模型预测。"

msgid "Camera-based adjacent spot monitoring using the driver camera. Supplements factory blind spot monitoring."
msgstr "使用驾驶员摄像头进行基于视觉的相邻盲区监测，作为原厂盲区监测的补充。"

msgid "Change the path width based on engagement."
msgstr "根据接合状态改变路径宽度。"

msgid "Choose Auto to follow ambient light with an adjustable offset, or Manual to set a fixed brightness while driving."
msgstr "选择\"自动\"可根据环境光并带可调偏移；选择\"手动\"可在行驶时设定固定亮度。"

msgid "Choose how many points define the custom acceleration curve."
msgstr "选择用多少个点来定义自定义加速曲线。"

msgid "Choose how strongly the vision model may override lane centering when it sees a hazard."
msgstr "选择视觉模型在发现危险时覆盖车道居中的强度。"

msgid "Choose the backup speed-limit source when the primary one is unavailable."
msgstr "选择主限速来源不可用时的备用限速来源。"

msgid "Choose the fingerprint platform to use when automatic detection is disabled."
msgstr "禁用自动识别时，选择要使用的指纹平台。"

msgid "Choose the first speed-limit source to trust when more than one is available."
msgstr "有多个限速来源时，选择优先信任的第一个来源。"

msgid "Choose the speed to use when no speed limit source is currently available."
msgstr "当前没有可用限速来源时使用的速度。"

msgid "Choose which camera feed the driving screen uses: Auto, Driver, Standard, or Wide."
msgstr "选择驾驶屏幕使用的摄像头画面：自动、驾驶员、标准或广角。"

msgid "Clear learned Curve Speed Controller data and begin training again from the default lateral acceleration."
msgstr "清除弯道速度控制器已学习的数据，并从默认横向加速度重新开始训练。"

msgid "Collect candidate object data on the 2022-2023 Kia Stinger for validation. Logging only: this does not enable radar-based braking or change steering. Default off. Keep driving normally, stay attentive, and upload full rlogs with bookmarked observations."
msgstr "在 2022-2023 起亚 Stinger 上采集候选目标数据用于验证。仅记录：不会启用基于雷达的制动，也不会改变转向。默认关闭。请正常驾驶、保持注意力，并上传带书签观察的完整 rlog。"

msgid "Color the driving path by planned acceleration and braking."
msgstr "按规划的加速与刹车为驾驶路径着色。"

msgid "Color the driving path like a rainbow road."
msgstr "将驾驶路径着成彩虹色。"

msgid "Configure up to three favorite toggles for on-road buttons and steering-wheel bindings."
msgstr "最多配置三个收藏开关，用于行驶屏幕按钮和方向盘绑定。"

msgid "Control and view the current driving personality via a driving screen widget."
msgstr "通过驾驶屏幕组件控制并查看当前驾驶风格。"

msgid "Controls how smoothly openpilot commits to a lane change. 10 is stock behavior; lower values produce a gentler, more gradual maneuver. 1 stretches the maneuver to ~8 seconds."
msgstr "控制 openpilot 执行变道的平顺度。10 为原厂行为；数值越低变道越轻柔渐进。1 会把变道拉长到约 8 秒。"

msgid "Custom StarPilot widgets for the driving screen."
msgstr "驾驶屏幕的自定义 StarPilot 组件。"

msgid "Customise settings for driving in heavy rain"
msgstr "自定义大雨驾驶的设置"

msgid "Customise settings for driving in light & medium rain"
msgstr "自定义小到中雨驾驶的设置"

msgid "Customise settings for driving in low visibility situations"
msgstr "自定义低能见度驾驶的设置"

msgid "Customise settings for driving in snow"
msgstr "自定义雪天驾驶的设置"

msgid "Customize braking, acceleration, and following distance for each profile."
msgstr "为每种风格自定义刹车、加速和跟车距离。"

msgid "Customize the \"Aggressive\" personality profile. Designed for assertive driving with tighter gaps."
msgstr "自定义\"激进\"驾驶风格。为更果断、跟车更近的驾驶而设计。"

msgid "Customize the \"Relaxed\" personality profile. Designed for smoother, more comfortable driving with larger gaps."
msgstr "自定义\"轻松\"驾驶风格。为更平顺舒适、跟车更远的驾驶而设计。"

msgid "Customize the \"Standard\" personality profile. Designed for balanced driving with moderate gaps."
msgstr "自定义\"标准\"驾驶风格。为均衡、跟车间距适中的驾驶而设计。"

msgid "Customize the \"Traffic Mode\" personality profile. Designed for stop-and-go driving."
msgstr "自定义\"拥堵模式\"驾驶风格。为走走停停的路况而设计。"

msgid "Delay before lateral control resumes after the turn signal is turned off. Only applies when the vehicle speed dropped below half the \"Pause Steering Below\" speed during the turn signal. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "转向灯关闭后横向控制恢复的延迟。仅在转向灯期间车速降至\"低于此速度暂停转向\"的一半以下时生效。设为 0 可禁用。"

msgid "Delay between turn signal activation and the start of an automatic lane change."
msgstr "转向灯激活到自动变道开始之间的延迟。"

msgid "Detailed information about openpilot's internal operations."
msgstr "关于 openpilot 内部运行的详细信息。"

msgid "Developer-only model lateral action smoothing. Default is 0.10 seconds."
msgstr "仅开发者：模型横向动作平滑。默认 0.10 秒。"

msgid "Developer-only model longitudinal action smoothing. Default is 0.30 seconds."
msgstr "仅开发者：模型纵向动作平滑。默认 0.30 秒。"

msgid "Developer-only: when Pulse and Glide is assigned to a wheel button, coast this far below the current cruise target before accelerating back up."
msgstr "仅开发者：当脉冲滑行绑定到方向盘按键时，滑行至比当前巡航目标低此数值后再加速恢复。"

msgid "Display the road name at the bottom of the driving screen using data from \"OpenStreetMap (OSM)\"."
msgstr "使用\"OpenStreetMap (OSM)\"的数据在驾驶屏幕底部显示道路名称。"

msgid "Display the side preview when a vehicle is detected in the blind spot, whether from factory BSM, V-ASM, or both."
msgstr "当盲区检测到车辆时显示侧视预览，来源可以是原厂 BSM、V-ASM 或两者。"

msgid "Display the side preview while the corresponding turn signal is engaged."
msgstr "相应转向灯开启期间显示侧视预览。"

msgid "Display the speed-limit sources and their current values on the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上显示限速来源及其当前数值。"

msgid "Enable only after entering valid Tesla pedal calibration values. Pedal-long stays inactive until this is on."
msgstr "仅在输入有效的特斯拉踏板校准值后才能启用。在开启之前，踏板纵向保持不激活。"

msgid "Enable openpilot longitudinal control for vehicles that support it. This replaces the vehicle's stock ACC and may disable automatic emergency braking. Changing this setting restarts the driving stack."
msgstr "为支持的车辆启用 openpilot 纵向控制。这会替换车辆原厂 ACC，并可能禁用自动紧急制动。更改此设置会重启驾驶栈。"

msgid "Enable this if the Bosch radar is mounted behind the nosecone instead of being exposed."
msgstr "如果博世雷达安装在前罩后方而非外露，请启用此项。"

msgid "Experimentally bias the model command toward the detected lane center. Requires two confident lane lines and remains subject to normal curvature and jerk limits."
msgstr "实验性地将模型指令偏向检测到的车道中心。需要两条置信车道线，且仍受常规曲率与加加速度限制。"

msgid "Fade lane-centering correction out when a turn signal is active so it does not fight a lane change or turn."
msgstr "转向灯激活时淡出车道居中修正，避免与变道或转向相争。"

msgid "Fade the gas and brake indicators based on how much openpilot is accelerating or braking."
msgstr "根据 openpilot 的加速或刹车强度淡化油门与刹车指示器。"

msgid "Flips the camera horizontally to switch whether your car's body appears on the inner/left or outer/right edge of the preview."
msgstr "水平翻转摄像头，用于切换车身出现在预览的内侧/左侧还是外侧/右侧。"

msgid "Follow distance to hold while changing lanes. Only applied when shorter than your normal gap."
msgstr "变道时保持的跟车距离。仅在短于常规车距时生效。"

msgid "Following distance for higher speeds in the \"Aggressive\" profile. openpilot smoothly blends from the base value to this value as speed rises."
msgstr "\"激进\"风格在高速时的跟车距离。车速升高时 openpilot 会从基础值平滑过渡到此值。"

msgid "Following distance for higher speeds in the \"Relaxed\" profile. openpilot smoothly blends from the base value to this value as speed rises."
msgstr "\"轻松\"风格在高速时的跟车距离。车速升高时 openpilot 会从基础值平滑过渡到此值。"

msgid "Following distance for higher speeds in the \"Standard\" profile. openpilot smoothly blends from the base value to this value as speed rises."
msgstr "\"标准\"风格在高速时的跟车距离。车速升高时 openpilot 会从基础值平滑过渡到此值。"

msgid "For Tesla Model 3 only. Converts light driver steering input into bounded steering-wheel rotation while lateral control remains active. Change while parked."
msgstr "仅限特斯拉 Model 3。在横向控制保持激活时，将轻微的驾驶员转向输入转换为受限的方向盘转动。请在停车时更改。"

msgid "For supported Subaru Outback 2023-24 and Legacy 2025 vehicles, send one momentary Stop/Start request after ignition while stationary and in Park or Neutral."
msgstr "对支持的斯巴鲁 Outback 2023-24 和 Legacy 2025，在点火后静止且处于 P 档或 N 档时发送一次瞬时启停请求。"

msgid "For the 2025 Subaru Legacy, request Auto Vehicle Hold once at startup while stopped in Park with the engine running. Manual choices are preserved. Enable before the next drive."
msgstr "对 2025 斯巴鲁 Legacy，在启动时于 P 档停车且发动机运转状态下请求一次自动驻车。手动选择会被保留。请在下次驾驶前启用。"

msgid "Force openpilot to stop whenever the driving model \"detects\" a red light or stop sign."
msgstr "当驾驶模型\"检测到\"红灯或停车标志时，强制 openpilot 停车。"

msgid "Force stop-and-go on Lexus/Toyota vehicles without stock stop-and-go functionality."
msgstr "为没有原厂走走停停功能的雷克萨斯/丰田车辆强制启用走走停停。"

msgid "Force stop-and-go on the 2017 Chevy Volt."
msgstr "为 2017 款雪佛兰 Volt 强制启用走走停停。"

msgid "Force the selected fingerprint and prevent it from changing automatically."
msgstr "强制使用所选指纹，并阻止其自动更改。"

msgid "Force-disable openpilot's live auto-tuning for \"Friction\" and \"Lateral Acceleration\" and use the set value instead."
msgstr "强制禁用 openpilot 对\"摩擦\"和\"横向加速度\"的实时自动调校，改用设定值。"

msgid "Force-enable openpilot's live auto-tuning for \"Friction\" and \"Lateral Acceleration\"."
msgstr "强制启用 openpilot 对\"摩擦\"和\"横向加速度\"的实时自动调校。"

msgid "Hide non-critical alerts from the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上隐藏非严重警报。"

msgid "Hide source rows that have no current speed limit reading. Works with both abbreviated and full display."
msgstr "隐藏当前无限速读数的来源行。简称和完整显示均适用。"

msgid "Hide the 'Changing Lanes' banner from the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上隐藏\"正在变道\"横幅。"

msgid "Hide the 'Turning Left/Right' banner from the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上隐藏\"左转/右转\"横幅。"

msgid "Hide the current speed from the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上隐藏当前速度。"

msgid "Hide the driver monitoring icon from the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上隐藏驾驶员监控图标。"

msgid "Hide the driving personality banner when changing distance profiles."
msgstr "切换车距风格时隐藏驾驶风格横幅。"

msgid "Hide the max speed from the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上隐藏最高速度。"

msgid "Hide the steering-wheel button from the top-right of the driving screen."
msgstr "隐藏驾驶屏幕右上角的方向盘按键。"

msgid "Hold supported GM vehicles at a stop until the gas pedal is pressed."
msgstr "让支持的 GM 车辆在停车后保持静止，直到踩下油门。"

msgid "Hold the brake pedal for over one second at a complete stop with cruise main on and cruise disengaged to hold until you press the gas pedal. Normal cruise stop-and-go is unchanged."
msgstr "在完全停止状态下，巡航主开关开启且巡航未接合时，踩住刹车超过一秒即可保持静止，直到踩下油门。常规巡航的走走停停不受影响。"

msgid "Hold the brakes after Jeep ACC times out at a stop, then send resume when traffic moves again."
msgstr "Jeep ACC 在停车时超时后保持刹车，待车流移动时发送恢复指令。"

msgid "How far ahead openpilot anticipates upcoming higher speed limits from downloaded map data."
msgstr "openpilot 根据已下载地图数据提前预判更高限速的距离。"

msgid "How far ahead openpilot anticipates upcoming lower speed limits from downloaded map data."
msgstr "openpilot 根据已下载地图数据提前预判更低限速的距离。"

msgid "How far below the set speed the car must be before open-road Conditional Chill can engage."
msgstr "在开阔道路启用条件 Chill 模式时，车速需低于设定速度多少。"

msgid "How firmly openpilot slows down. \"Eco\" favors coasting, \"Sport\" applies stronger braking."
msgstr "openpilot 减速的力度。\"经济\"倾向滑行，\"运动\"施加更强制动。"

msgid "How long the device can stay offroad before clearing the active route. Set to 0 for immediate clearing."
msgstr "设备停车后多久清除当前路线。设为 0 表示立即清除。"

msgid "How long the driving screen stays awake before Standby Mode turns it off."
msgstr "待机模式关闭前驾驶屏幕保持唤醒的时长。"

msgid "How long the parked screen stays awake after a touch."
msgstr "停车屏幕在触摸后保持唤醒的时长。"

msgid "How many hours the device stays on after a drive before it shuts down automatically."
msgstr "一次驾驶结束后设备在自动关机前保持开机的小时数。"

msgid "How many seconds openpilot follows behind lead vehicles when using the \"Aggressive\" profile. Increase for more space; decrease for tighter gaps."
msgstr "使用\"激进\"风格时 openpilot 与前车保持的秒数。调大留出更多空间，调小拉近距离。"

msgid "How many seconds openpilot follows behind lead vehicles when using the \"Relaxed\" profile. Increase for more space; decrease for tighter gaps."
msgstr "使用\"轻松\"风格时 openpilot 与前车保持的秒数。调大留出更多空间，调小拉近距离。"

msgid "How many seconds openpilot follows behind lead vehicles when using the \"Standard\" profile. Increase for more space; decrease for tighter gaps."
msgstr "使用\"标准\"风格时 openpilot 与前车保持的秒数。调大留出更多空间，调小拉近距离。"

msgid "How much extra space openpilot keeps from the vehicle ahead. Increase for larger gaps and more cautious following; decrease for tighter gaps and closer following."
msgstr "openpilot 与前车保持的额外间距。调大跟车更远更谨慎，调小跟车更近。"

msgid "How much the set speed increases or decreases for each + or – cruise control button press."
msgstr "每次短按 + 或 – 巡航键时设定速度变化多少。"

msgid "How much the set speed increases or decreases while holding the + or – cruise control buttons."
msgstr "长按 + 或 – 巡航键时设定速度变化多少。"

msgid "How much to offset posted speed-limits between 0 and 24 mph."
msgstr "对 0–24 mph 区间限速的偏移量。"

msgid "How much to offset posted speed-limits between 25 and 34 mph."
msgstr "对 25–34 mph 区间限速的偏移量。"

msgid "How much to offset posted speed-limits between 35 and 44 mph."
msgstr "对 35–44 mph 区间限速的偏移量。"

msgid "How much to offset posted speed-limits between 45 and 54 mph."
msgstr "对 45–54 mph 区间限速的偏移量。"

msgid "How much to offset posted speed-limits between 55 and 64 mph."
msgstr "对 55–64 mph 区间限速的偏移量。"

msgid "How much to offset posted speed-limits between 65 and 74 mph."
msgstr "对 65–74 mph 区间限速的偏移量。"

msgid "How much to offset posted speed-limits between 75 and 99 mph."
msgstr "对 75–99 mph 区间限速的偏移量。"

msgid "How quickly openpilot speeds up. \"Eco\" is gentle and efficient, \"Sport\" is firmer and more responsive, and \"Sport+\" accelerates at the maximum rate allowed."
msgstr "openpilot 加速的快慢。\"经济\"轻柔高效，\"运动\"更果断灵敏，\"运动+\"以允许的最大速率加速。"

msgid "How sensitive openpilot is to detecting vehicles. Higher sensitivity allows quicker detection at longer distances but may react to non-vehicle objects; lower sensitivity is more conservative and reduces false detections."
msgstr "openpilot 检测车辆的灵敏度。灵敏度越高，远距离检测越快，但可能对非车辆物体作出反应；灵敏度越低越保守，可减少误检。"

msgid "How smoothly openpilot accelerates. Increase for gentler starts; decrease for faster but more abrupt takeoffs."
msgstr "openpilot 加速的平顺度。调大起步更柔和，调小起步更快但更突兀。"

msgid "How smoothly openpilot brakes. Increase for gentler stops; decrease for quicker but sharper braking."
msgstr "openpilot 刹车的平顺度。调大停车更柔和，调小刹车更快但更生硬。"

msgid "How smoothly openpilot slows down. Increase for more gradual deceleration; decrease for faster but sharper slowdowns."
msgstr "openpilot 减速的平顺度。调大减速更渐进，调小减速更快但更生硬。"

msgid "How smoothly openpilot speeds up. Increase for more gradual acceleration; decrease for quicker but more jolting acceleration."
msgstr "openpilot 加速的平顺度。调大加速更渐变，调小加速更快但更颠簸。"

msgid "Increase the set speed by the chosen offset. For example, set +5 if you usually drive 5 over the limit."
msgstr "按所选偏移量提高设定速度。例如你通常超速 5，就设为 +5。"

msgid "Keep \"Experimental Mode\" on by default, but temporarily switch to \"Chill Mode\" in simple cruising scenes where speed holding is usually better."
msgstr "默认保持\"实验模式\"，但在速度保持通常更好的简单巡航场景下临时切换到\"Chill 模式\"。"

msgid "Keep Experimental Mode active on an open road after reaching the set speed when no lead vehicle is detected. This can help the model anticipate braking sooner."
msgstr "在开阔道路达到设定速度且未检测到前车时保持实验模式激活。这有助于模型更早预判制动。"

msgid "Keep openpilot in the standstill state until you press the gas pedal or the Resume/+ cruise button."
msgstr "让 openpilot 保持静止状态，直到你踩下油门或按下 RES/+ 巡航键。"

msgid "Keep the driving screen awake while an eGPU model loads so you can watch its status. The normal timeout resumes when loading finishes. A manual Screen Off action still works."
msgstr "在 eGPU 模型加载期间保持驾驶屏幕常亮，方便查看状态。加载结束后恢复正常超时。手动熄屏操作仍然有效。"

msgid "Keep your manual Conditional Chill override through reboots until you manually clear it."
msgstr "重启后保留手动条件 Chill 覆盖，直到你手动清除。"

msgid "Keep your manual Conditional Experimental override through reboots until you manually clear it."
msgstr "重启后保留手动条件实验模式覆盖，直到你手动清除。"

msgid "Lane-change behavior that mimics human drivers by anticipating and tracking adjacent vehicles during lane changes."
msgstr "模仿人类驾驶员的变道行为，在变道过程中预判并跟踪相邻车辆。"

msgid "Limit automatic lane changes to one per turn-signal activation."
msgstr "限制每次转向灯激活只能自动变道一次。"

msgid "Limit openpilot's maximum driving speed using configured map, dashboard, and optional vision sources. Press + above a limit for a persistent override; hold the gas pedal for a temporary override."
msgstr "使用已配置的地图、仪表和可选视觉来源限制 openpilot 的最高行驶速度。在限速以上按 + 可持久覆盖；踩住油门可临时覆盖。"

msgid "Limit the strongest acceleration openpilot can command."
msgstr "限制 openpilot 可指令的最大加速度。"

msgid "Lower the desired speed while driving through curves in a rainstorm. Increase for safer, gentler turns; decrease for more aggressive driving in curves."
msgstr "暴雨中过弯时降低目标速度。调大过弯更安全柔和，调小过弯更激进。"

msgid "Lower the desired speed while driving through curves in low visibility. Increase for safer, gentler turns; decrease for more aggressive driving in curves."
msgstr "低能见度下过弯时降低目标速度。调大过弯更安全柔和，调小过弯更激进。"

msgid "Lower the desired speed while driving through curves in rain. Increase for safer, gentler turns; decrease for more aggressive driving in curves."
msgstr "雨天过弯时降低目标速度。调大过弯更安全柔和，调小过弯更激进。"

msgid "Lower the desired speed while driving through curves in snow. Increase for safer, gentler turns; decrease for more aggressive driving in curves."
msgstr "雪天过弯时降低目标速度。调大过弯更安全柔和，调小过弯更激进。"

msgid "Lower the maximum acceleration in a rainstorm. Increase for softer takeoffs; decrease for quicker but less stable takeoffs."
msgstr "降低暴雨中的最大加速度。调大起步更柔和，调小起步更快但更不稳。"

msgid "Lower the maximum acceleration in low visibility. Increase for softer takeoffs; decrease for quicker but less stable takeoffs."
msgstr "降低低能见度下的最大加速度。调大起步更柔和，调小起步更快但更不稳。"

msgid "Lower the maximum acceleration in rain. Increase for softer takeoffs; decrease for quicker but less stable takeoffs."
msgstr "降低雨天的最大加速度。调大起步更柔和，调小起步更快但更不稳。"

msgid "Lower the maximum acceleration in snow. Increase for softer takeoffs; decrease for quicker but less stable takeoffs."
msgstr "降低雪天的最大加速度。调大起步更柔和，调小起步更快但更不稳。"

msgid "Map the Acceleration or Deceleration profiles to the vehicle's \"Eco\" and \"Sport\" gear modes."
msgstr "将加速或减速曲线映射到车辆的\"经济\"和\"运动\"档位模式。"

