msgid "openpilot's steering remains active even when the accelerator or brake pedals are pressed."
msgstr "即使踩下油门或刹车踏板，openpilot 的转向仍保持激活。"

msgid "Show the current offset on the compact driving display. The unified Max Set / Speed Limit card always shows nonzero offsets."
msgstr "在精简驾驶显示上显示当前偏移。统一的\"最大设定/限速\"卡片始终显示非零偏移。"

msgid "Pressing the brake fully turns off Always On Lateral. Steering stays off after the brake is released until openpilot is engaged again or AOL is manually toggled back on."
msgstr "踩刹车会完全关闭常开横向控制（AOL）。松开刹车后转向保持关闭，直到 openpilot 再次接合或手动重新开启 AOL。"

msgid "Miscellaneous acceleration and braking control changes to fine-tune how openpilot drives."
msgstr "其他加速与刹车控制调整，用于微调 openpilot 的驾驶表现。"

msgid "Play a short chime when the external GPU model finishes loading. Driving alerts take priority."
msgstr "外部 GPU 模型加载完成时播放短提示音。驾驶警报优先。"

msgid "Set the volume for softer warnings about potential risks.\n\nExamples include: \"BRAKE! Risk of Collision\", \"Steering Temporarily Unavailable\"."
msgstr "设置关于潜在风险的柔和警告音量。\n\n示例：\"刹车！碰撞风险\"、\"转向暂时不可用\"。"

msgid "Vehicle speed in mph for curve point 6."
msgstr "曲线点 6 的车速（mph）。"

msgid "Save drive footage in higher video quality."
msgstr "以更高画质保存行车录像。"

msgid "Maximum acceleration in m/s² at curve point 1."
msgstr "曲线点 1 的最大加速度（m/s²）。"

msgid "Vehicle speed in mph for curve point 7."
msgstr "曲线点 7 的车速（mph）。"

msgid "The minimum following distance to the lead vehicle. openpilot blends between this value and the \"Relaxed\" profile as speed increases. Increase for more space; decrease for tighter gaps."
msgstr "与前车的最小跟车距离。车速升高时 openpilot 会在该值与\"轻松\"风格之间过渡。调大留出更多空间，调小拉近距离。"

msgid "Play an alert when the lead vehicle departs from a stop."
msgstr "前车从静止起步时播放警报。"

msgid "Only pause steering when the turn signal is active."
msgstr "仅在转向灯激活时暂停转向。"

msgid "Use the stock Bosch radar path on pre-Autopilot Teslas."
msgstr "在 Pre-Autopilot 特斯拉上使用原厂博世雷达通路。"

msgid "Use the manual-parking-brake Subaru stop-and-go strategy. Enable this for supported Subaru Global models with a manual handbrake. Keep it off on models with an electric parking brake."
msgstr "使用手动驻车制动的斯巴鲁走走停停策略。适用于带手动手刹的斯巴鲁全球车型；配备电子驻车制动的车型请保持关闭。"

msgid "Rotate the driving screen wheel with the physical steering wheel."
msgstr "驾驶屏幕上的方向盘随实际方向盘转动。"

msgid "Play the infamous \"Goat Scream\" when the steering controller reaches its limit. Based on the \"Turn Exceeds Steering Limit\" event."
msgstr "转向控制器达到极限时播放著名的\"山羊尖叫\"。基于\"转向超过极限\"事件。"

msgid "Shift the lane target left or right in meters. The controller reduces this offset automatically when the detected lane is narrow."
msgstr "以米为单位将车道目标左移或右移。检测到车道较窄时控制器会自动减小该偏移。"

msgid "Maximum acceleration in m/s² at curve point 7."
msgstr "曲线点 7 的最大加速度（m/s²）。"

msgid "Use the vehicle's stock longitudinal control instead of openpilot longitudinal control. This can stop openpilot from sending cruise-control acceleration and braking commands on supported vehicles."
msgstr "使用车辆原厂纵向控制而非 openpilot 纵向控制。这会阻止 openpilot 在支持的车辆上发送巡航加速与制动指令。"

msgid "Wake the screen from Standby when driving assistance engages."
msgstr "驾驶辅助接合时从待机状态唤醒屏幕。"

msgid "Select your car make."
msgstr "选择你的汽车品牌。"

msgid "WARNING: This suppresses openpilot's excessive longitudinal actuation diagnostic when measured acceleration looks impossible for the requested gas/brake command.\n\nLeave this OFF unless you are intentionally testing edge cases like shifting to neutral and understand that it can hide a real actuation problem."
msgstr "警告：当实测加速度与所请求的油门/刹车指令明显不符时，此选项会抑制 openpilot 的\"纵向执行过度\"诊断。\n\n除非你有意测试切换到空档等边界情况，并理解它可能掩盖真实的执行故障，否则请保持关闭。"

msgid "Vehicle provides additional space around hazards like cyclists and vehicles crossing into the lane."
msgstr "车辆会在自行车、并入车道的车辆等危险物周围留出额外空间。"

msgid "Switch to \"Experimental Mode\" when using a turn signal below the set speed to allow the model to choose an appropriate speed for smoother left and right turns."
msgstr "低于设定速度打转向灯时切换到\"实验模式\"，让模型自行选择合适的车速，使左右转弯更平顺。"

msgid "Set a custom filled-path color for the Python UIs.\n\nUse Stock to follow the default path color behavior."
msgstr "为 Python 界面设置自定义填充路径颜色。\n\n选择\"原厂\"以跟随默认路径配色。"

msgid "On supported Chevy Volts in L / single-pedal mode, blend friction braking so the car can slow to a stop and hold without using the brake pedal."
msgstr "对支持 L 档/单踏板模式的雪佛兰 Volt，混合摩擦制动，使车辆无需踩刹车踏板即可减速停车并保持。"

msgid "Performance data, sensor readings, and system metrics for debugging and optimizing openpilot."
msgstr "用于调试和优化 openpilot 的性能数据、传感器读数和系统指标。"

msgid "Use the original moving confidence ball on the small comma 4 UI instead of the fixed confidence, CEM/CCM, and personality sidebar."
msgstr "在小型 comma 4 界面上使用原来的移动置信球，替代固定的置信、CEM/CCM 和风格侧栏。"

msgid "Scale steering during high-speed lane changes."
msgstr "高速变道时缩放转向。"

msgid "Maximum acceleration in m/s² at curve point 2."
msgstr "曲线点 2 的最大加速度（m/s²）。"

msgid "Set the volume for the loudest warnings that require urgent attention.\n\nExamples include: \"DISENGAGE IMMEDIATELY — Driver Distracted\", \"DISENGAGE IMMEDIATELY — Driver Unresponsive\"."
msgstr "设置需要紧急关注的最高等级警告音量。\n\n示例：\"立即解除 — 驾驶员分心\"、\"立即解除 — 驾驶员无响应\"。"

msgid "Play an alert when the model predicts a red light has turned green.\n\nDisclaimer: openpilot does not explicitly detect traffic lights. This alert is based on end-to-end model predictions from camera input and may trigger even when the light has not changed."
msgstr "当模型预测红灯变绿时播放警报。\n\n免责声明：openpilot 并不显式检测红绿灯。此警报基于摄像头输入的端到端模型预测，即使信号灯未变化也可能触发。"

msgid "While driving below the minimum lane change speed with an active turn signal, instruct openpilot to turn left/right."
msgstr "低于最低变道速度且转向灯激活时，指示 openpilot 左转/右转。"

msgid "Set the driving-path width.\n\nDefault (6.1 feet) matches the width of a 2019 Lexus ES 350."
msgstr "设置驾驶路径宽度。\n\n默认值（6.1 英尺）相当于 2019 雷克萨斯 ES 350 的车宽。"

msgid "Zero point used to convert Tesla pedal interceptor output into the internal DI range."
msgstr "用于将特斯拉踏板拦截器输出转换到内部 DI 范围的零点。"

msgid "Maximum acceleration in m/s² at curve point 11."
msgstr "曲线点 11 的最大加速度（m/s²）。"

msgid "Show which condition triggered \"Experimental Mode\" on the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上显示触发\"实验模式\"的条件。"

msgid "Tune where Force Stops bring the car to rest. Positive values let the car roll further before stopping (longer stop, closer to the line). Negative values stop the car sooner (more buffer before the line)."
msgstr "调整强制停车的停车位置。正值让车辆滑行更远再停（停车更晚、更靠近停止线）；负值让车辆提前停下（停止线前留更多余量）。"

msgid "How many seconds openpilot follows behind lead vehicles when using the \"Relaxed\" profile. Increase for more space; decrease for tighter gaps.\n\nDefault: 1.6 seconds."
msgstr "使用\"轻松\"风格时 openpilot 与前车保持的秒数。调大留出更多空间，调小拉近距离。\n\n默认：1.6 秒。"

msgid "Use Panda firmware that ignores the physical ignition line and starts from CAN ignition only.\n\nRequires a Panda flash. Use this only on vehicles with reliable CAN ignition when the harness box reports false ignition."
msgstr "使用忽略物理点火线、仅从 CAN 点火启动的 Panda 固件。\n\n需要刷写 Panda。仅在线束盒误报点火且车辆 CAN 点火可靠时使用。"

msgid "On supported Hyundai stock-cruise cars, use RES/SET button presses to match the cluster set speed to StarPilot's target."
msgstr "对支持的现代原厂巡航车型，用 RES/SET 按键把仪表设定速度对齐到 StarPilot 的目标速度。"

msgid "Speed limits, and other navigation widgets."
msgstr "限速及其他导航组件。"

msgid "Use a comma pedal interceptor for acceleration and regenerative braking on pre-Autopilot Teslas."
msgstr "在 Pre-Autopilot 特斯拉上使用 comma 踏板拦截器实现加速与能量回收制动。"

msgid "Upload driving data to \"stable.konik.ai\" instead of \"connect.comma.ai\"."
msgstr "将驾驶数据上传到\"stable.konik.ai\"而非\"connect.comma.ai\"。"

msgid "Keep openpilot in the standstill state until you press the gas pedal or the Resume/+ cruise button.\n\nThis applies to any engaged stop, not just red lights or stop signs."
msgstr "让 openpilot 保持静止状态，直到你踩下油门或按下 RES/+ 巡航键。\n\n这适用于任何接合状态下的停车，不仅限于红灯或停车标志。"

msgid "Render the speed-limit sources as compact text labels (e.g. \"Dash-45\", \"MapD-30\") without icons."
msgstr "将限速来源渲染为紧凑文字标签（如\"Dash-45\"、\"MapD-30\"），不显示图标。"

msgid "Set a custom path-edge color for the Python UIs.\n\nUse Stock to follow the default line color behavior."
msgstr "为 Python 界面设置自定义路径边缘颜色。\n\n选择\"原厂\"以跟随默认线条配色。"

msgid "Select the CAN bus used by the Tesla pedal interceptor."
msgstr "选择特斯拉踏板拦截器使用的 CAN 总线。"

msgid "Temporarily switch the device to the offroad state for remote updates when the vehicle is parked. This control is only available while the vehicle reports Park."
msgstr "车辆停放时临时将设备切换到停车状态以便远程更新。仅当车辆报告处于 P 档时可用。"

msgid "Mute only the sound for \"Turn Exceeds Steering Limit\" below this speed. The visual alert is always kept visible. Set to 0 to disable. The value uses your selected mph or km/h unit."
msgstr "仅在此速度以下静音\"转向超过极限\"的声音。视觉警报始终保留。设为 0 可禁用。数值使用你所选的 mph 或 km/h 单位。"

msgid "On pedal-interceptor Bolts, treat the steering-wheel CANCEL button as an extra mappable button."
msgstr "对踏板拦截器版 Bolt，将方向盘 CANCEL 键视为额外的可映射按键。"

msgid "Temporal smoothing duration (0.1-0.5 seconds, default 0.2). Higher values reduce flicker but add latency."
msgstr "时间平滑时长（0.1–0.5 秒，默认 0.2）。数值越大越减少抖动，但会增加延迟。"

msgid "Vehicle speed in mph for curve point 11."
msgstr "曲线点 11 的车速（mph）。"

msgid "Open Galaxy (new) at the top-level Galaxy link. Turn this off to use Galaxy (old) instead. Galaxy (old) remains available at /classic and Galaxy (new) at /mobile."
msgstr "在顶层 Galaxy 链接处打开 Galaxy（新版）。关闭则使用 Galaxy（旧版）。旧版仍可通过 /classic 访问，新版在 /mobile。"

msgid "Wake the screen from Standby and keep it awake while an informational alert is displayed."
msgstr "显示信息类警报时从待机状态唤醒屏幕并保持常亮。"

msgid "Switch to \"Experimental Mode\" when a slower lead vehicle is detected ahead."
msgstr "前方检测到较慢前车时切换到\"实验模式\"。"

msgid "Require a steering-wheel nudge for lane changes while using Always On Lateral without full engagement."
msgstr "使用常开横向控制但未完全接合时，变道需要轻推方向盘确认。"

msgid "On supported Subaru Impreza-family cars, use stock Resume/Set button presses to match the cluster set speed to StarPilot's target."
msgstr "对支持的斯巴鲁翼豹系列车型，用原厂 RESUME/SET 按键把仪表设定速度对齐到 StarPilot 的目标速度。"

msgid "Show the driving paths for the left and right lanes."
msgstr "显示左右车道的行驶路径。"

msgid "When enabled, your comma can wake up when your Tesla wakes up. When disabled, it normally powers on when you press the brake."
msgstr "启用后，你的 comma 可随特斯拉一起唤醒。禁用时，通常在踩刹车时开机。"

msgid "Wake the screen from Standby and keep it awake while a warning alert is displayed."
msgstr "显示警告类警报时从待机状态唤醒屏幕并保持常亮。"

msgid "Set the volume for prompts when openpilot detects driver distraction or unresponsiveness.\n\nExamples include: \"Pay Attention\", \"Touch Steering Wheel\"."
msgstr "设置 openpilot 检测到驾驶员分心或无响应时的提示音量。\n\n示例：\"请集中注意力\"、\"请触摸方向盘\"。"

msgid "Show advanced settings in Galaxy."
msgstr "在 Galaxy 中显示高级设置。"

msgid "Show the hands-free assistance graphic on supported CAN-FD Ford clusters while lateral control is active. Driver monitoring requirements do not change."
msgstr "在支持的 CAN-FD 福特仪表上，横向控制激活时显示免手辅助图形。驾驶员监控要求不变。"

msgid "Wake the screen from Standby when a turn signal is activated."
msgstr "激活转向灯时从待机状态唤醒屏幕。"

msgid "Maximum acceleration in m/s² at curve point 12."
msgstr "曲线点 12 的最大加速度（m/s²）。"

msgid "How many seconds openpilot follows behind lead vehicles when using the \"Standard\" profile. Increase for more space; decrease for tighter gaps.\n\nDefault: 1.45 seconds."
msgstr "使用\"标准\"风格时 openpilot 与前车保持的秒数。调大留出更多空间，调小拉近距离。\n\n默认：1.45 秒。"

msgid "Settings that control screen brightness, screen recording, and timeout duration."
msgstr "控制屏幕亮度、屏幕录制和超时时长的设置。"

msgid "Maximum acceleration in m/s² at curve point 3."
msgstr "曲线点 3 的最大加速度（m/s²）。"

msgid "Show numerical device temperature in the driving screen developer metrics."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕的开发者指标中显示设备温度数值。"

msgid "When openpilot is first enabled, automatically set the max speed to the current posted limit."
msgstr "openpilot 首次接合时，自动将最高速度设为当前限速。"

msgid "Use acceleration profiles tuned for EVs. Defaults to the vehicle's detected powertrain type but can be overridden if the automatic choice doesn't match."
msgstr "使用为电动车调校的加速曲线。默认跟随车辆检测到的动力类型，若自动选择不匹配可手动覆盖。"

msgid "Require confirmation before applying a newly detected higher speed limit."
msgstr "应用新检测到的更高限速前需要确认。"

msgid "When the turn signal is on, openpilot will automatically change lanes. If a vehicle is detected in the blind spot, the lane change waits until it is clear. No steering-wheel nudge required!"
msgstr "打开转向灯时，openpilot 会自动变道。若盲区检测到车辆，变道会等待其离开。无需轻推方向盘！"

msgid "Switch to \"Experimental Mode\" when a slower or stopped vehicle is detected. Can make braking smoother and more reliable on some vehicles."
msgstr "检测到较慢或停止的车辆时切换到\"实验模式\"。在某些车辆上可让刹车更平顺可靠。"

msgid "Maximum acceleration in m/s² at curve point 10."
msgstr "曲线点 10 的最大加速度（m/s²）。"

msgid "Temporarily switch to \"Chill Mode\" when starting from a stop if planner is already allowing throttle. Useful if your car launches too slowly from lights or stop signs."
msgstr "从静止起步时若规划器已允许油门，临时切换到\"Chill 模式\"。适用于车辆从红灯或停车标志起步太慢的情况。"

msgid "Vehicle tries to center itself and slowly adjusts away from hazards, but may react too slowly."
msgstr "车辆尝试居中，并缓慢远离危险物，但可能反应偏慢。"

msgid "Maximum acceleration in m/s² at curve point 9."
msgstr "曲线点 9 的最大加速度（m/s²）。"

msgid "Set the lane-line thickness.\n\nDefault matches the MUTCD lane-line width standard of 4 inches."
msgstr "设置车道线粗细。\n\n默认值符合 MUTCD 车道线宽度标准（4 英寸）。"

msgid "Switch to \"Experimental Mode\" when a curve is detected to allow the model to set an appropriate speed for the curve."
msgstr "检测到弯道时切换到\"实验模式\"，让模型为该弯道选择合适的车速。"

msgid "Switch to \"Experimental Mode\" when driving below this speed without a lead to help openpilot handle low-speed situations more smoothly."
msgstr "低于此速度且无前车时切换到\"实验模式\"，帮助 openpilot 更平顺地处理低速场景。"

msgid "Settings that control how the device runs, powers off, and manages driving data."
msgstr "控制设备运行、关机以及驾驶数据管理的设置。"

msgid "Prevent large uploads on cellular. Turn this off to allow full/unfiltered uploads over mobile data."
msgstr "阻止通过蜂窝网络进行大文件上传。关闭后允许通过移动数据完整上传。"

msgid "Play a louder alert if a vehicle is in the blind spot when attempting to change lanes. Based on the \"Car Detected in Blindspot\" event."
msgstr "尝试变道时若盲区有车，播放更响的警报。基于\"盲区检测到车辆\"事件。"

msgid "Reduce maximum acceleration as you close in on a lead vehicle when Tesla pedal-long is active."
msgstr "特斯拉踏板纵向激活时，接近前车过程中降低最大加速度。"

msgid "Set the volume for the chime when openpilot engages, such as after pressing the \"RESUME\" or \"SET\" steering wheel buttons."
msgstr "设置 openpilot 接合时的提示音音量，例如按下方向盘 RESUME 或 SET 键之后。"

msgid "Only enable this if the wide camera is broken or for development!\n\nDisabling the wide camera may degrade driving performance and cause instability.\n\nRequires a reboot to take effect."
msgstr "仅在广角摄像头损坏或开发调试时启用！\n\n禁用广角摄像头可能降低驾驶性能并导致不稳定。\n\n需要重启才能生效。"

msgid "Reverse Toyota/Lexus cruise-button behavior so a short press changes the dashboard set speed by 5 and a hold changes it by 1."
msgstr "反转丰田/雷克萨斯的巡航按键行为：短按使仪表设定速度变化 5，长按变化 1。"

msgid "Show the current speed limit on the driving screen. The position depends on the device UI. Uses data from the car's dashboard (if supported) and \"OpenStreetMap (OSM)\"."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上显示当前限速。位置取决于设备界面。使用车辆仪表数据（若支持）和\"OpenStreetMap (OSM)\"。"

msgid "Show which condition triggered \"Chill Mode\" on the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上显示触发\"Chill 模式\"的条件。"

msgid "Model visualizations for the driving path, lane lines, path edges, and road edges."
msgstr "驾驶路径、车道线、路径边缘和道路边缘的模型可视化。"

msgid "Play the infamous \"Goat Scream\" for full-screen critical alerts that require immediate takeover.\n\nExamples include: \"TAKE CONTROL IMMEDIATELY\" and \"Stock AEB: Risk of Collision\"."
msgstr "对需要立即接管的全面屏严重警报播放著名的\"山羊尖叫\"。\n\n示例：\"立即接管\"、\"原厂 AEB：碰撞风险\"。"

msgid "Switch to \"Chill Mode\" when following a steady, well-tracked lead vehicle at cruising speeds."
msgstr "在巡航速度下跟随稳定且跟踪良好的前车时切换到\"Chill 模式\"。"

msgid "Vision-detected limits at or below this value will not control speed. The value uses your selected mph or km/h unit."
msgstr "低于或等于此数值的视觉检测限速不参与速度控制。数值使用你所选的 mph 或 km/h 单位。"

msgid "Wake the screen from Standby and keep it awake while a critical or takeover alert is displayed."
msgstr "显示严重或接管类警报时从待机状态唤醒屏幕并保持常亮。"

msgid "Show the \"Curve Speed Controller\" target speed on the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上显示\"弯道速度控制器\"的目标速度。"

msgid "Show GPU usage in the driving screen developer metrics."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕的开发者指标中显示 GPU 占用。"

msgid "Show the driver camera feed when the vehicle is in reverse."
msgstr "倒车时显示驾驶员摄像头画面。"

msgid "Show the current driving direction with a simple on-screen compass."
msgstr "用一个简单的屏幕罗盘显示当前行驶方向。"

msgid "Switch to \"Experimental Mode\" when driving below this speed with a lead."
msgstr "有前车且低于此速度行驶时切换到\"实验模式\"。"

msgid "Multiplier for dashboard speed. 1x = no offset; 1.05x = 5% faster."
msgstr "仪表速度的倍率。1x = 无偏移；1.05x = 快 5%。"

msgid "Toggle Always On Lateral by touching the Tesla screen with three fingers. Requires the Model 3/Y Vehicle CAN add-on cable, which is detected automatically. Does not engage or cancel cruise control. Restart the device after changing this setting or the AOL brake behavior when screen taps are enabled."
msgstr "用三根手指触摸特斯拉屏幕来切换常开横向控制。需要 Model 3/Y Vehicle CAN 附加线缆（会自动检测）。不会接合或取消巡航控制。更改此设置，或在屏幕触控启用时更改 AOL 刹车行为后，请重启设备。"

msgid "Smoothen acceleration and braking when driving downhill/uphill."
msgstr "下坡/上坡时使加速和刹车更平顺。"

msgid "Color the driving path like a rainbow road.\n\nOn the Python UIs this overrides acceleration and braking path coloring."
msgstr "将驾驶路径着成彩虹色。\n\n在 Python 界面上，这会覆盖加速与刹车路径着色。"

msgid "Use the left paddle to pause openpilot acceleration and braking while Always On Lateral stays active on supported Hyundai CAN-FD cars."
msgstr "在支持的现代 CAN-FD 车辆上，用左拨片暂停 openpilot 的加速与刹车，同时常开横向控制保持激活。"

msgid "Play an alert when the posted speed limit changes."
msgstr "限速变化时播放警报。"

msgid "Use the pedal interceptor for full longitudinal control on supported GM vehicles."
msgstr "在支持的 GM 车辆上使用踏板拦截器实现完整纵向控制。"

msgid "Show the frames per second at the bottom of the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕底部显示每秒帧数。"

msgid "WARNING: This will prevent your drives from being recorded and all data will be unobtainable!\n\nPrevent the device from saving driving data."
msgstr "警告：这会阻止记录你的驾驶，所有数据都将无法获取！\n\n阻止设备保存驾驶数据。"

msgid "WARNING: This will prevent your drives from being uploaded to comma connect which will impact debugging and official support from comma!\n\nPrevent the device from uploading driving data."
msgstr "警告：这会阻止将驾驶数据上传到 comma connect，将影响调试和 comma 的官方支持！\n\n阻止设备上传驾驶数据。"

msgid "Vehicle reacts to hazards recognized by the vision model as quickly as possible."
msgstr "车辆以尽可能快的速度对视觉模型识别到的危险物作出反应。"

msgid "Turn off the screen after the onroad timeout. Touch and ignition changes always wake it. Choose additional wake events below."
msgstr "超过行驶超时后关闭屏幕。触摸和点火变化总会唤醒它。可在下方选择额外的唤醒事件。"

msgid "Set the volume for prompts that need attention.\n\nExamples include: \"Car Detected in Blindspot\", \"Steering Temporarily Unavailable\", \"Turn Exceeds Steering Limit\"."
msgstr "设置需要关注的提示音量。\n\n示例：\"盲区检测到车辆\"、\"转向暂时不可用\"、\"转向超过极限\"。"

msgid "Show a temporary Picture-in-Picture bubble of the side window while the turn signal is on or a blind spot is detected."
msgstr "转向灯开启或检测到盲区时，显示侧窗的临时画中画气泡。"

msgid "Switch to \"Experimental Mode\" when openpilot predicts a stop within the set time. This is usually triggered when the model \"sees\" a red light or stop sign ahead.\n\nDisclaimer: openpilot does not explicitly detect traffic lights or stop signs. In \"Experimental Mode\", openpilot makes end-to-end driving decisions from camera input, which means it may stop even when there's no clear reason!"
msgstr "openpilot 预测在设定时间内停车时切换到\"实验模式\"。通常在模型\"看到\"前方红灯或停车标志时触发。\n\n免责声明：openpilot 并不显式检测红绿灯或停车标志。在\"实验模式\"下，openpilot 基于摄像头输入做端到端驾驶决策，因此即使没有明确原因也可能停车！"

msgid "Scale the active Honda lateralTuning.pid.kpV values from openDBC. Applies live to Honda PID lateral only."
msgstr "缩放来自 openDBC 的当前本田 lateralTuning.pid.kpV 数值。仅对本田 PID 横向实时生效。"

msgid "Tint the on-screen steering-wheel icon green while accelerating and red while braking. Also show gas and brake indicators.\n\nDynamic: Opacity changes according to how much openpilot is accelerating or braking\nStatic: Full when active, dim when not"
msgstr "加速时把屏幕方向盘图标着成绿色，刹车时着成红色。同时显示油门和刹车指示。\n\n动态：不透明度随 openpilot 的加速或刹车强度变化\n静态：激活时全亮，未激活时变暗"

msgid "Use Vienna-style (EU) speed-limit signs on the compact driving display. The unified Max Set / Speed Limit card uses its own layout."
msgstr "在精简驾驶显示上使用维也纳式（欧盟）限速标志。统一的\"最大设定/限速\"卡片使用自己的布局。"

msgid "Twilsonco's \"Neural Network FeedForward\" controller. Uses a trained neural network model to predict steering torque based on vehicle speed, roll, and past/future planned path data for smoother, model-based steering."
msgstr "Twilsonco 的\"神经网络前馈\"控制器。使用训练好的神经网络模型，根据车速、侧倾以及过去/未来规划路径预测转向扭矩，实现更平顺的模型化转向。"

msgid "Switch to \"Experimental Mode\" whenever the driving model \"detects\" a red light or stop sign.\n\nDisclaimer: openpilot does not explicitly detect traffic lights or stop signs. In \"Experimental Mode\", openpilot makes end-to-end driving decisions from camera input, which means it may stop even when there's no clear reason!"
msgstr "每当驾驶模型\"检测到\"红灯或停车标志时切换到\"实验模式\"。\n\n免责声明：openpilot 并不显式检测红绿灯或停车标志。在\"实验模式\"下，openpilot 基于摄像头输入做端到端驾驶决策，因此即使没有明确原因也可能停车！"

msgid "How many seconds openpilot follows behind lead vehicles when using the \"Aggressive\" profile. Increase for more space; decrease for tighter gaps.\n\nDefault: 1.25 seconds."
msgstr "使用\"激进\"风格时 openpilot 与前车保持的秒数。调大留出更多空间，调小拉近距离。\n\n默认：1.25 秒。"

msgid "Switch to \"Chill Mode\" on open roads above this speed when no lead is detected and the car is still below the set speed."
msgstr "在开阔道路上高于此速度、未检测到前车且车速仍低于设定速度时，切换到\"Chill 模式\"。"

msgid "Replace the built-in acceleration profile with your own speed breakpoints and maximum-acceleration values. The starting curve mirrors the selected acceleration profile plus EV or Truck tuning."
msgstr "用你自己的速度断点和最大加速度值替换内置加速曲线。起始曲线会参照所选加速曲线并叠加电动车或卡车调校。"

msgid "While parked, if the battery voltage falls below the set level, the device shuts down to prevent excessive battery drain."
msgstr "停车时若电池电压低于设定值，设备会关机以避免过度耗电。"

msgid "Show a red path when a vehicle is in that lane's blind spot."
msgstr "当某车道盲区有车时，将该车道路径显示为红色。"

msgid "Use the Extreme harness angle channel with cooperative torque fallback."
msgstr "使用 Extreme 线束角度通道，并带回退的协同扭矩。"

msgid "Miscellaneous visual changes to fine-tune how the driving screen looks."
msgstr "其他视觉调整，用于微调驾驶屏幕的外观。"

msgid "Vehicle smooths out hazard avoidance, making less rapid adjustments."
msgstr "车辆对危险物避让更平滑，调整幅度更小。"

msgid "Wake the screen from Standby when driving assistance disengages."
msgstr "驾驶辅助解除时从待机状态唤醒屏幕。"

msgid "Maximum acceleration in m/s² at curve point 8."
msgstr "曲线点 8 的最大加速度（m/s²）。"

msgid "Use Mapbox speed-limit data when no other source is available."
msgstr "没有其他来源时使用 Mapbox 限速数据。"

msgid "Minimum vehicle-detection confidence (0.80-1.00, default 0.94). Higher values reduce false positives but may miss detections."
msgstr "车辆检测的最低置信度（0.80–1.00，默认 0.94）。数值越高越少误报，但可能漏检。"

msgid "Vehicle speed in mph for curve point 5."
msgstr "曲线点 5 的车速（mph）。"

msgid "Switch to \"Experimental Mode\" when a stopped lead vehicle is detected ahead."
msgstr "前方检测到停止的前车时切换到\"实验模式\"。"

msgid "Show the lead-vehicle marker on the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上显示前车标记。"

msgid "Play the loud blind spot alert while lateral control is off or paused. Useful when steering pauses on turn signal, since the lane-change state machine is inactive then."
msgstr "横向控制关闭或暂停时也播放盲区加响警报。当转向灯时暂停转向尤其有用，因为此时变道状态机处于非激活。"

msgid "Vehicle speed in mph for curve point 8."
msgstr "曲线点 8 的车速（mph）。"

msgid "Virtually shift the camera perspective used by the driving model. Positive values bias the model center left; negative values bias it right. Use only for development."
msgstr "虚拟移动驾驶模型使用的摄像头视角。正值使模型中心偏左，负值偏右。仅供开发使用。"

msgid "Vehicle speed in mph for curve point 2."
msgstr "曲线点 2 的车速（mph）。"

msgid "WARNING: Running at higher temperatures may damage your device!\n\nAllow the device to run at higher temperatures before throttling or shutting down. Use only if you understand the risks!"
msgstr "警告：在更高温度下运行可能损坏设备！\n\n允许设备在降频或关机前承受更高温度。仅在你了解风险时使用！"

msgid "Show CPU usage in the driving screen developer metrics."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕的开发者指标中显示 CPU 占用。"

msgid "Show memory usage in the driving screen developer metrics."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕的开发者指标中显示内存占用。"

msgid "Set the volume for the \"Steer Unavailable Under\" alert shown below the car's minimum steering speed.\n\nSet to Muted to silence only this alert."
msgstr "设置\"低于此速度转向不可用\"警报的音量，该警报在低于车辆最低转向速度时显示。\n\n设为\"静音\"可仅关闭此警报。"

msgid "Set the minimum time between repeated steering-limit and minimum-steer-speed alerts while \"Switchback Mode\" is active. Useful on winding roads where \"Turn Exceeds Steering Limit\" and \"Steer Unavailable Under\" can repeat frequently. Set to Off to disable the cooldown even when the mode is on."
msgstr "设置\"往返模式\"激活时，重复的转向极限与最低转向速度警报之间的最短间隔。适用于\"转向超过极限\"和\"低于此速度转向不可用\"频繁重复的蜿蜒道路。设为\"关闭\"可在该模式开启时也禁用冷却。"

msgid "Vehicle speed in mph for curve point 12."
msgstr "曲线点 12 的车速（mph）。"

msgid "Scaling factor used to convert Tesla pedal interceptor output into the internal DI range."
msgstr "用于将特斯拉踏板拦截器输出转换到内部 DI 范围的缩放系数。"

msgid "Steering control changes to fine-tune how openpilot drives."
msgstr "转向控制调整，用于微调 openpilot 的驾驶表现。"

msgid "Use the road camera to detect and display speed-limit signs, with optional use by Speed Limit Controller."
msgstr "使用道路摄像头检测并显示限速标志，可选择供限速控制器使用。"

msgid "When \"Disable Uploads\" is enabled, allow uploads only while parked (offroad)."
msgstr "启用\"禁用上传\"时，仅允许在停车状态下上传。"

msgid "Vehicle speed in mph for curve point 4."
msgstr "曲线点 4 的车速（mph）。"

msgid "When SLC is enabled, prevent it from acting on vision-detected speed limits at or below the configured threshold. Detection, display, debugging, and training collection remain active."
msgstr "启用 SLC 时，阻止其对等于或低于设定阈值的视觉检测限速起作用。检测、显示、调试和训练采集仍保持运行。"

msgid "Use the remote-climate Hyundai/Kia/Genesis CAN-FD panda firmware at boot.\n\nRequired for EV remote-climate startup signal behavior."
msgstr "启动时使用支持远程空调的现代/起亚/捷尼赛思 CAN-FD panda 固件。\n\n电动车远程空调启动信号行为必需。"

msgid "Change the path width based on engagement.\n\nFully Engaged: 100%\nAlways On Lateral: 75%\nDisengaged: 50%"
msgstr "根据接合状态改变路径宽度。\n\n完全接合：100%\n常开横向：75%\n未接合：50%"

msgid "Runs the fan on a lower, more aggressive temperature curve: the fan ramps up sooner and reacts faster to rising temperature, keeping the device meaningfully cooler on hot days at the cost of more fan noise."
msgstr "以更低温度曲线运行风扇：风扇更早启动并对温度上升反应更快，在炎热天气下让设备明显更凉，代价是风扇噪音更大。"

msgid "Wake the screen from Standby when a recognised Bluetooth, controller or steering wheel button is pressed, including buttons without an assigned action."
msgstr "按下已识别的蓝牙、控制器或方向盘按键（包括未分配动作的按键）时，从待机状态唤醒屏幕。"

msgid "Only use Curve Speed Controller when not following a lead vehicle."
msgstr "仅在未跟随前车时使用弯道速度控制器。"

msgid "Pause \"Always On Lateral\" below the set speed while the brake pedal is pressed."
msgstr "踩下刹车时，低于设定速度暂停\"常开横向控制\"。"

msgid "Show a popup banner when the Python driving UIs switch into chill, experimental, switchback, or override mode."
msgstr "Python 驾驶界面切换到 chill、实验、往返或覆盖模式时显示弹出横幅。"

msgid "Prevent automatic lane changes into lanes narrower than the set width."
msgstr "阻止自动变道进入窄于设定宽度的车道。"

msgid "Use a more stock-like presentation by hiding most branch-specific UI, theme, sound, and alert styling. This only changes presentation and does not change driving behavior."
msgstr "通过隐藏大部分分支专属的界面、主题、音效和警报样式，呈现更接近原厂的外观。这仅改变呈现方式，不会改变驾驶行为。"

msgid "Scale the active Honda lateralTuning.pid.kiV values from openDBC. Applies live to Honda PID lateral only."
msgstr "缩放来自 openDBC 的当前本田 lateralTuning.pid.kiV 数值。仅对本田 PID 横向实时生效。"

msgid "Override upload blocks and always keep uploader enabled. Advanced use only."
msgstr "覆盖上传限制并始终保持上传器启用。仅供高级用途。"

msgid "Use torque-based steering control instead of angle-based control for smoother lane keeping, especially in curves."
msgstr "使用基于扭矩的转向控制而非基于角度的控制，使车道保持更平顺，尤其在弯道中。"

msgid "Set the volume for alerts when openpilot disengages.\n\nExamples include: \"Cruise Fault: Restart the Car\", \"Parking Brake Engaged\", \"Pedal Pressed\"."
msgstr "设置 openpilot 解除时的警报音量。\n\n示例：\"巡航故障：请重启车辆\"、\"驻车制动已启用\"、\"踏板被踩下\"。"

msgid "Maximum acceleration in m/s² at curve point 6."
msgstr "曲线点 6 的最大加速度（m/s²）。"

msgid "Vehicle speed in mph for curve point 10."
msgstr "曲线点 10 的车速（mph）。"

msgid "Maximum acceleration in m/s² at curve point 5."
msgstr "曲线点 5 的最大加速度（m/s²）。"

msgid "Show full-strength gas and brake indicators when active, and dim them when inactive."
msgstr "激活时以全强度显示油门和刹车指示，未激活时变暗。"

msgid "Maximum acceleration in m/s² at curve point 4."
msgstr "曲线点 4 的最大加速度（m/s²）。"

msgid "Use aggressive acceleration profiles tuned for trucks. Intended for heavy vehicles that need stronger throttle."
msgstr "使用为卡车调校的激进加速曲线。适用于需要更强油门的重型车辆。"

msgid "Save lower-threshold vision sign candidates into the debug session for later training import without showing or applying them live. Leave this on if you want to help improve the model."
msgstr "将较低阈值的视觉标志候选保存到调试会话，以便之后导入训练，而不实时显示或应用。如果你想帮助改进模型，请保持开启。"

msgid "Set the driving-path edge width that represents different driving modes and statuses.\n\nDefault is 20% of the total path width.\n\nColor Guide:\n\n- Light Blue: Always On Lateral\n- Green: Default\n- Orange: Experimental Mode\n- Red: Traffic Mode\n- Yellow: Conditional Experimental Mode overridden"
msgstr "设置表示不同驾驶模式和状态的驾驶路径边缘宽度。\n\n默认为总路径宽度的 20%。\n\n颜色说明：\n\n- 浅蓝：常开横向控制\n- 绿色：默认\n- 橙色：实验模式\n- 红色：拥堵模式\n- 黄色：条件实验模式已被覆盖"

msgid "Use the vehicle's wheel speed instead of the cluster speed. This is purely a visual change and doesn't impact how openpilot drives!"
msgstr "使用车辆轮速而非仪表速度。这纯粹是视觉变化，不影响 openpilot 的驾驶方式！"

msgid "Use the remote-start GM panda firmware at boot.\n\nRequired for GM remote-start startup signal behavior."
msgstr "启动时使用支持远程启动的 GM panda 固件。\n\nGM 远程启动信号行为必需。"

msgid "Turns on/off using radar data to track leads at standstill, making following/takeoffs more responsive once leads move."
msgstr "开启/关闭使用雷达数据跟踪静止前车，使前车移动后的跟车/起步响应更灵敏。"

msgid "Stop and go for supported Subaru vehicles."
msgstr "对支持的斯巴鲁车辆启用走走停停。"

msgid "Set the volume for alerts when openpilot refuses to engage.\n\nExamples include: \"Brake Hold Active\", \"Door Open\", \"Seatbelt Unlatched\"."
msgstr "设置 openpilot 拒绝接合时的警报音量。\n\n示例：\"制动保持激活\"、\"车门未关\"、\"安全带未系\"。"

msgid "Opt-in ARS510 radar on Toyota RAV4 2022-2025, including hybrids. ACC Target uses the radar's selected lead; Fused Tracks filters the full object list. Off preserves vision-only operation. Restart the device after changing this setting. Does not enable Alpha Long, restore AEB, or change tuning. Collect validation routes and remain ready to take over."
msgstr "在 2022-2025 丰田 RAV4（含混动）上选择性启用 ARS510 雷达。ACC 目标使用雷达选定的前车；融合轨迹用于筛选完整目标列表。关闭则保持纯视觉运行。更改此设置后请重启设备。不会启用 Alpha 纵向、恢复 AEB 或改变调校。请采集验证路线并随时准备接管。"

msgid "Require confirmation before applying a newly detected lower speed limit."
msgstr "应用新检测到的更低限速前需要确认。"

msgid "Set how loud each type of openpilot alert is to keep routine prompts from becoming distracting."
msgstr "设置各类 openpilot 警报的音量，避免常规提示过于打扰。"

msgid "Yield during an intentional manual turn while keeping the Ford steering session ready."
msgstr "在有意手动转向时让行，同时保持福特转向会话就绪。"

msgid "On GM pedal-long cars, add the configured set-speed offset to the spoofed dash set speed so it matches the on-screen set speed."
msgstr "在 GM 踏板纵向车辆上，将配置的设定速度偏移加到伪装的仪表设定速度上，使其与屏幕显示一致。"

msgid "Switch to \"Chill Mode\" when following a stable lead above this speed."
msgstr "高于此速度跟随稳定前车时切换到\"Chill 模式\"。"

msgid "Set a custom lane-line color for the Python UIs.\n\nUse Stock to follow the default line color behavior."
msgstr "为 Python 界面设置自定义车道线颜色。\n\n选择\"原厂\"以跟随默认线条配色。"

msgid "Scale the driving-screen border thickness.\n\n100% matches the stock border width."
msgstr "缩放驾驶屏幕边框粗细。\n\n100% 与原厂边框宽度一致。"

msgid "Show a timer when stopped in place of the current speed to indicate how long the vehicle has been stopped."
msgstr "停车时用计时器替代当前速度显示，以指示已停止多久。"

msgid "Vehicle speed in mph for curve point 3."
msgstr "曲线点 3 的车速（mph）。"

msgid "Use automatic brightness with an adjustable offset, or Manual to set a fixed brightness while parked."
msgstr "停车时使用带可调偏移的自动亮度，或选择\"手动\"设定固定亮度。"

msgid "Force openpilot to stop whenever the driving model \"detects\" a red light or stop sign.\n\nDisclaimer: openpilot does not explicitly detect traffic lights or stop signs. In \"Experimental Mode\", openpilot makes end-to-end driving decisions from camera input, which means it may stop even when there's no clear reason!"
msgstr "当驾驶模型\"检测到\"红灯或停车标志时，强制 openpilot 停车。\n\n免责声明：openpilot 并不显式检测红绿灯或停车标志。在\"实验模式\"下，openpilot 基于摄像头输入做端到端驾驶决策，因此即使没有明确原因也可能停车！"

msgid "The turn-speed hack from comma's 2022 \"Taco Bell Run\". Designed to slow down for left and right turns."
msgstr "来自 comma 2022 年\"Taco Bell Run\"的转向速度补丁。用于左右转弯时减速。"

msgid "Vehicle rigidly tries to center itself rather than avoiding hazards, potholes, or road debris."
msgstr "车辆僵硬地试图居中，而不避让危险物、坑洞或路面障碍。"

msgid "Miscellaneous steering control changes to fine-tune how openpilot drives."
msgstr "其他转向控制调整，用于微调 openpilot 的驾驶表现。"

msgid "Vehicle speed in mph for curve point 9."
msgstr "曲线点 9 的车速（mph）。"

msgid "Vehicle speed in mph for curve point 1. Breakpoint speeds must increase from one point to the next."
msgstr "曲线点 1 的车速（mph）。断点速度必须逐点递增。"

msgid "Set the road-edge thickness.\n\nDefault matches half of the MUTCD lane-line width standard of 4 inches."
msgstr "设置道路边缘粗细。\n\n默认值符合 MUTCD 车道线宽度标准（4 英寸）的一半。"

msgid "Fine-tunes openpilot's steering control."
msgstr "微调 openpilot 的转向控制。"

msgid "Learns steering delay; ignores the manual value."
msgstr "学习转向延迟；忽略手动设定值。"

msgid "Auto-tunes steering friction and lateral acceleration."
msgstr "自动调校转向摩擦和横向加速度。"

msgid "Uses fixed values instead of live steering auto-tuning."
msgstr "使用固定值而非实时转向自动调校。"

msgid "Uses torque-based steering for smoother lane keeping."
msgstr "使用基于扭矩的转向，使车道保持更平顺。"

msgid "Keeps steering active when pressing the gas or brake."
msgstr "踩油门或刹车时保持转向激活。"

msgid "Keep steering off after pressing the brake until you deliberately re-engage it."
msgstr "踩刹车后保持转向关闭，直到你主动重新接合。"

msgid "Toggle steering with a three-finger screen touch using the Vehicle CAN add-on cable."
msgstr "使用 Vehicle CAN 附加线缆时，用三指触摸屏幕切换转向。"

msgid "Enables openpilot lane changes."
msgstr "启用 openpilot 变道。"

msgid "Changes lanes automatically when the turn signal is on."
msgstr "打转向灯时自动变道。"

msgid "Requires a nudge unless full openpilot control is engaged."
msgstr "未完全接合 openpilot 时需要轻推方向盘。"

msgid "Limits automatic lane changes to one per signal."
msgstr "每次转向灯仅允许自动变道一次。"

msgid "Temporarily shortens the follow gap during lane changes."
msgstr "变道时临时缩短跟车距离。"

msgid "Additional settings for fine-tuning steering control."
msgstr "用于微调转向控制的额外设置。"

msgid "Allows turn desires below lane-change speed with a signal."
msgstr "低于变道速度时打灯也允许转向意图。"

msgid "Allows navigation to request low-speed turns."
msgstr "允许导航请求低速转向。"

msgid "Uses route-based lane positioning after torque confirmation."
msgstr "扭矩确认后使用基于路线的车道定位。"

msgid "Uses a neural network to smooth steering torque."
msgstr "使用神经网络平滑转向扭矩。"

msgid "Uses planned path data to smooth steering in curves."
msgstr "使用规划路径数据平滑弯道转向。"

msgid "Adds quality-of-life steering changes."
msgstr "添加提升体验的转向调整。"

msgid "Pauses steering when the turn signal is active."
msgstr "转向灯激活时暂停转向。"

msgid "Uses the driver camera for adjacent-spot monitoring."
msgstr "使用驾驶员摄像头进行相邻盲区监测。"

msgid "Fine-tunes openpilot's acceleration and braking."
msgstr "微调 openpilot 的加速与刹车。"

msgid "Uses acceleration profiles tuned for EV powertrains."
msgstr "使用为电动车动力调校的加速曲线。"

msgid "Uses stronger acceleration profiles for heavy vehicles."
msgstr "为重型车辆使用更强的加速曲线。"

msgid "Uses custom maximum-acceleration values by speed."
msgstr "按车速使用自定义最大加速度值。"

msgid "Enables Experimental Mode for configured conditions."
msgstr "在设定条件下启用实验模式。"

msgid "Keeps a manual Experimental Mode override after reboot."
msgstr "重启后保留手动实验模式覆盖。"

msgid "Enables Experimental Mode when a curve is detected ahead."
msgstr "前方检测到弯道时启用实验模式。"

msgid "Uses Experimental Mode for predicted red lights or stops."
msgstr "对预测的红灯或停止使用实验模式。"

msgid "Uses Experimental Mode for a slower or stopped lead."
msgstr "对较慢或停止的前车使用实验模式。"

msgid "Keeps Experimental Mode active on open roads without a lead."
msgstr "无前车的开阔道路上保持实验模式。"

msgid "Uses Experimental Mode when a slower lead is detected."
msgstr "检测到较慢前车时使用实验模式。"

msgid "Uses Experimental Mode when a stopped lead is detected."
msgstr "检测到停止前车时使用实验模式。"

msgid "Shows which condition triggered Experimental Mode."
msgstr "显示触发实验模式的条件。"

msgid "Slows for upcoming curves using your driving history."
msgstr "根据你的驾驶历史为即将到来的弯道减速。"

msgid "Shows the Curve Speed Controller target speed."
msgstr "显示弯道速度控制器的目标速度。"

msgid "Uses Curve Speed Controller only without a lead."
msgstr "仅在无前车时使用弯道速度控制器。"

msgid "Learned cornering comfort from your driving data."
msgstr "从驾驶数据学习到的过弯舒适度。"

msgid "How much curve data has been collected."
msgstr "已采集的弯道数据量。"

msgid "Customizes driving personalities to match your style."
msgstr "自定义驾驶风格以匹配你的习惯。"

msgid "Customizes Traffic Mode for stop-and-go driving."
msgstr "为走走停停路况自定义拥堵模式。"

msgid "Customizes Aggressive Mode for assertive driving."
msgstr "为果断驾驶自定义激进模式。"

msgid "Customizes Standard Mode for balanced driving."
msgstr "为均衡驾驶自定义标准模式。"

msgid "Customizes Relaxed Mode for smoother driving."
msgstr "为平顺驾驶自定义轻松模式。"

msgid "Additional acceleration and braking tuning."
msgstr "额外的加速与刹车调校。"

msgid "Chooses how quickly openpilot accelerates."
msgstr "选择 openpilot 的加速快慢。"

msgid "Chooses how firmly openpilot slows down."
msgstr "选择 openpilot 的减速力度。"

msgid "Anticipates nearby traffic during lane changes."
msgstr "变道时预判周边车流。"

msgid "Slows for turns using the Taco Bell Run hack."
msgstr "使用 Taco Bell Run 补丁在转弯时减速。"

msgid "Lets navigation lower cruise speed for upcoming turns."
msgstr "允许导航为即将到来的转弯降低巡航速度。"

msgid "Adds quality-of-life acceleration and braking changes."
msgstr "添加提升体验的加速与刹车调整。"

msgid "Swaps Toyota/Lexus short-press and hold cruise increments."
msgstr "交换丰田/雷克萨斯巡航按键短按与长按的步进。"

msgid "Commands stops for model-predicted red lights or stop signs."
msgstr "对模型预测的红灯或停车标志指令停车。"

msgid "Holds standstill until you press gas or Resume/+."
msgstr "保持静止直到你踩油门或按 RES/+。"

msgid "Uses radar to improve lead takeoffs from a stop."
msgstr "使用雷达改善前车起步时的跟随。"

msgid "Maps Accel/Decel profiles to Eco and Sport gear modes."
msgstr "将加速/减速曲线映射到经济与运动档位模式。"

msgid "Adjusts driving behavior for current weather."
msgstr "根据当前天气调整驾驶行为。"

msgid "Asks before applying a new speed limit."
msgstr "应用新限速前先询问。"

msgid "Asks before applying a lower speed limit."
msgstr "应用更低限速前先询问。"

msgid "Asks before applying a higher speed limit."
msgstr "应用更高限速前先询问。"

msgid "Matches the speed limit when openpilot engages."
msgstr "接合时匹配限速。"

msgid "Chooses the speed when no limit source is available."
msgstr "没有限速来源时选择使用的速度。"

msgid "Uses Mapbox speed limits as a fallback."
msgstr "使用 Mapbox 限速作为备用。"

msgid "Chooses the backup speed-limit source."
msgstr "选择备用限速来源。"

msgid "Shows the offset on the compact display; the unified card always shows nonzero offsets."
msgstr "在精简显示上显示偏移；统一卡片始终显示非零偏移。"

msgid "Shows speed-limit sources and their current values."
msgstr "显示限速来源及其当前数值。"

msgid "Temporarily uses Chill Mode during simple cruising."
msgstr "简单巡航时临时使用 Chill 模式。"

msgid "Keeps a manual Chill Mode override after reboot."
msgstr "重启后保留手动 Chill 模式覆盖。"

msgid "Uses Chill Mode when following a steady lead."
msgstr "跟随稳定前车时使用 Chill 模式。"

msgid "Uses Chill Mode for smoother launches from a stop."
msgstr "从静止起步时使用 Chill 模式，起步更平顺。"

msgid "Shows which condition triggered Chill Mode."
msgstr "显示触发 Chill 模式的条件。"

msgid "Shows speed-limit sources as compact text labels."
msgstr "将限速来源显示为紧凑文字标签。"

msgid "Hides speed-limit sources with no current reading."
msgstr "隐藏当前无读数的限速来源。"

msgid "Detects and displays speed-limit signs with the road camera."
msgstr "使用道路摄像头检测并显示限速标志。"

msgid "Ignores vision speed limits below the configured threshold."
msgstr "忽略低于设定阈值的视觉限速。"

msgid "Saves confirmed vision speed-limit signs for training."
msgstr "保存已确认的视觉限速标志用于训练。"

msgid "Saves extra vision sign samples for training."
msgstr "保存额外的视觉标志样本用于训练。"

msgid "Preserves route segments containing auto-bookmarks."
msgstr "保留包含自动书签的路线分段。"

msgid "Additional settings for fine-tuning the driving screen."
msgstr "用于微调驾驶屏幕的额外设置。"

msgid "Hides current speed from the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上隐藏当前速度。"

msgid "Shows the detected lead vehicle."
msgstr "显示检测到的前车。"

msgid "Hides the max-speed indicator from the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上隐藏最高速度指示。"

msgid "Hides non-critical alerts from the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上隐藏非严重警报。"

msgid "Hides the steering-wheel button on the driving screen."
msgstr "隐藏驾驶屏幕上的方向盘按键。"

msgid "Uses wheel speed instead of cluster speed for display."
msgstr "显示时使用轮速而非仪表速度。"

msgid "Applies seasonal themes automatically."
msgstr "自动应用季节性主题。"

msgid "Enables StarPilot widgets on the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上启用 StarPilot 组件。"

msgid "Colors the path by planned acceleration and braking."
msgstr "按规划的加速与刹车为路径着色。"

msgid "Colors the driving path like a rainbow."
msgstr "将驾驶路径着成彩虹色。"

msgid "Shows a banner when driving mode changes."
msgstr "驾驶模式变化时显示横幅。"

msgid "Shows driving paths for adjacent lanes."
msgstr "显示相邻车道的行驶路径。"

msgid "Marks adjacent paths when a blind spot is detected."
msgstr "检测到盲区时标记相邻路径。"

msgid "Shows a side-camera preview on a turn signal or blind spot."
msgstr "打转向灯或检测到盲区时显示侧摄像头预览。"

msgid "Shows the side preview while a turn signal is on."
msgstr "转向灯开启时显示侧视预览。"

msgid "Shows the side preview when a blind spot is detected."
msgstr "检测到盲区时显示侧视预览。"

msgid "Keep off for the default view with the car body along the inside edge."
msgstr "保持关闭可让车身位于内侧边缘的默认视角。"

msgid "Shows driving direction with an on-screen compass."
msgstr "用屏幕罗盘显示行驶方向。"

msgid "Controls and shows driving personality from a widget."
msgstr "通过组件控制和显示驾驶风格。"

msgid "Colors the driving-screen wheel by acceleration and braking, with optional pedal indicators."
msgstr "按加速与刹车为屏幕方向盘着色，可选显示踏板指示。"

msgid "Fades pedal indicators with acceleration and braking."
msgstr "踏板指示随加速与刹车淡入淡出。"

msgid "Shows full pedal indicators when active; dims otherwise."
msgstr "激活时全强度显示踏板指示，否则变暗。"

msgid "Rotates the driving-screen wheel with the physical wheel."
msgstr "屏幕方向盘随实际方向盘转动。"

msgid "Shows model paths, lane lines, and road edges."
msgstr "显示模型路径、车道线和道路边缘。"

msgid "Changes path width with engagement state."
msgstr "路径宽度随接合状态变化。"

msgid "Shows navigation and speed-limit widgets."
msgstr "显示导航和限速组件。"

msgid "Clears the active route when the device goes offroad."
msgstr "设备停车时清除当前路线。"

msgid "Shows the current road name on the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上显示当前道路名称。"

msgid "Shows the current speed limit on the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上显示当前限速。"

msgid "Uses Vienna-style signs on the compact display."
msgstr "在精简显示上使用维也纳式标志。"

msgid "Chooses the camera feed used by the driving screen."
msgstr "选择驾驶屏幕使用的摄像头画面。"

msgid "Shows the driver camera feed in reverse."
msgstr "倒车时显示驾驶员摄像头画面。"

msgid "Shows how long the vehicle has been stopped."
msgstr "显示车辆已停止多久。"

msgid "Uses the stock moving confidence ball on comma 4."
msgstr "在 comma 4 上使用原厂移动置信球。"

msgid "Uses a stock-like UI without changing driving behavior."
msgstr "使用接近原厂的界面，不改变驾驶行为。"

msgid "Hides the Changing Lanes banner."
msgstr "隐藏\"正在变道\"横幅。"

msgid "Hides the personality banner when distance changes."
msgstr "切换车距时隐藏驾驶风格横幅。"

msgid "Hides the driver-monitoring icon."
msgstr "隐藏驾驶员监控图标。"

msgid "Hides the Turning Left/Right banner."
msgstr "隐藏\"左转/右转\"横幅。"

msgid "Disables the wide camera; may reduce driving performance."
msgstr "禁用广角摄像头；可能降低驾驶性能。"

msgid "Sets the volume for each alert type."
msgstr "设置各类警报的音量。"

msgid "Plays Goat Scream at the steering limit."
msgstr "达到转向极限时播放山羊尖叫。"

msgid "Plays Goat Scream for critical takeover alerts."
msgstr "对严重接管警报播放山羊尖叫。"

msgid "Alerts when the model predicts a light turned green."
msgstr "模型预测绿灯亮起时发出警报。"

msgid "Alerts when a stopped lead vehicle departs."
msgstr "停止的前车起步时发出警报。"

msgid "Plays a louder alert for blind-spot lane changes."
msgstr "盲区变道时播放更响的警报。"

msgid "Plays the blind-spot alert when steering is paused."
msgstr "转向暂停时也播放盲区警报。"

msgid "Alerts when the posted speed limit changes."
msgstr "限速变化时发出警报。"

msgid "Uses the Extreme harness angle channel with torque fallback."
msgstr "使用 Extreme 线束角度通道，并带回退扭矩。"

msgid "Locks the selected fingerprint; disables auto-detection."
msgstr "锁定所选指纹；禁用自动识别。"

msgid "Uses right-hand-drive driver monitoring."
msgstr "使用右舵驾驶员监控。"

msgid "Uses stock longitudinal control instead of openpilot."
msgstr "使用原厂纵向控制而非 openpilot。"

msgid "Adds cooperative steering for Tesla Model 3."
msgstr "为特斯拉 Model 3 添加协同转向。"

msgid "Uses stock Bosch radar on pre-Autopilot Teslas."
msgstr "在 Pre-Autopilot 特斯拉上使用原厂博世雷达。"

msgid "Enables radar mounted behind the nosecone."
msgstr "启用安装在前罩后方的雷达。"

msgid "Uses a comma pedal for acceleration on pre-Autopilot Teslas."
msgstr "在 Pre-Autopilot 特斯拉上使用 comma 踏板加速。"

msgid "Chooses the CAN bus for the Tesla pedal interceptor."
msgstr "选择特斯拉踏板拦截器的 CAN 总线。"

msgid "Limits acceleration near a lead on Tesla pedal-long."
msgstr "特斯拉踏板纵向时限制接近前车时的加速度。"

msgid "Enables Tesla pedal-long after calibration."
msgstr "校准后启用特斯拉踏板纵向。"

msgid "Uses the pedal interceptor for GM longitudinal control."
msgstr "使用踏板拦截器实现 GM 纵向控制。"

msgid "Applies GM pedal-long set-speed offsets to the dash."
msgstr "将 GM 踏板纵向的设定速度偏移应用到仪表。"

msgid "Uses CAN ignition only; requires a Panda flash."
msgstr "仅使用 CAN 点火；需要刷写 Panda。"

msgid "Smooths pedal response on hills."
msgstr "在坡道上平滑踏板响应。"

msgid "Uses GM remote-start firmware at boot."
msgstr "启动时使用 GM 远程启动固件。"

msgid "Allow your comma to wake up with your Tesla."
msgstr "允许你的 comma 随特斯拉一起唤醒。"

msgid "Uses Hyundai/Kia/Genesis remote-climate firmware at boot."
msgstr "启动时使用现代/起亚/捷尼赛思远程空调固件。"

msgid "Adds stop-and-go to the 2017 Chevy Volt."
msgstr "为 2017 雪佛兰 Volt 添加走走停停。"

msgid "Holds supported GM vehicle brakes until the gas pedal is pressed."
msgstr "让支持的 GM 车辆保持刹车直到踩下油门。"

msgid "Adds blended braking for one-pedal Chevy Volt driving."
msgstr "为单踏板雪佛兰 Volt 驾驶添加混合制动。"

msgid "Holds Jeep brakes after ACC stops, then resumes in traffic."
msgstr "ACC 停车后保持 Jeep 刹车，车流移动时恢复。"

msgid "Enables stop-and-go on supported Subarus."
msgstr "在支持的斯巴鲁上启用走走停停。"

msgid "Enables manual-handbrake stop-and-go on supported Subarus."
msgstr "在支持的斯巴鲁上启用手动手刹走走停停。"

msgid "Requests AVH ON at startup on the 2025 Legacy."
msgstr "在 2025 Legacy 启动时请求开启 AVH。"

msgid "Requests Stop/Start OFF once after ignition on supported Subarus."
msgstr "在支持的斯巴鲁上点火后请求一次关闭启停。"

msgid "Adds stop-and-go to Lexus/Toyota vehicles without it."
msgstr "为没有走走停停的雷克萨斯/丰田车辆添加该功能。"

msgid "Holds supported Toyota/Lexus brakes after a manual stop with cruise disengaged."
msgstr "巡航未接合时手动停车后保持支持的丰田/雷克萨斯刹车。"

msgid "Experimental radar parsing for 2022-2025 RAV4s; disabled by default."
msgstr "2022-2025 RAV4 的实验性雷达解析；默认关闭。"

msgid "Makes the Bolt CANCEL button available for remapping."
msgstr "让 Bolt 的 CANCEL 键可用于重映射。"

msgid "Adds Hyundai CAN-FD left-paddle acceleration/braking pause."
msgstr "添加现代 CAN-FD 左拨片加速/刹车暂停。"

msgid "Controls device power, data, and recording."
msgstr "控制设备电源、数据和录制。"

msgid "Prevents drive logging; leave off unless testing."
msgstr "阻止记录驾驶；除非测试否则请关闭。"

msgid "Prevents drives from uploading to comma connect."
msgstr "阻止驾驶数据上传到 comma connect。"

msgid "Disables uploads while driving; allows them while parked."
msgstr "行驶时禁用上传，停车时允许。"

msgid "Keeps uploads enabled despite upload blocks."
msgstr "即使有上传限制也保持上传启用。"

msgid "Saves drive footage at higher quality."
msgstr "以更高画质保存行车录像。"

msgid "Limits uploads over cellular data."
msgstr "限制通过蜂窝网络上传。"

msgid "Allows higher temperatures; may damage the device."
msgstr "允许更高温度；可能损坏设备。"

msgid "Cooler-running, louder fan curve for comma 3/3X."
msgstr "comma 3/3X 更凉但更吵的风扇曲线。"

msgid "Uploads driving data to the Konik server."
msgstr "将驾驶数据上传到 Konik 服务器。"

msgid "Controls screen brightness, recording, and timeout."
msgstr "控制屏幕亮度、录制和超时。"

msgid "Keep the driving screen awake during eGPU model loading."
msgstr "eGPU 模型加载期间保持驾驶屏幕常亮。"

msgid "Adds a driving-screen button to record the display."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上添加录制屏幕的按钮。"

msgid "Turn off the driving screen after inactivity and choose additional wake events."
msgstr "闲置后关闭驾驶屏幕，并选择额外的唤醒事件。"

msgid "Enables developer controls and diagnostics."
msgstr "启用开发者控制与诊断。"

msgid "Shows performance and sensor metrics for debugging."
msgstr "显示用于调试的性能与传感器指标。"

msgid "Shows frames per second on the driving screen."
msgstr "在驾驶屏幕上显示每秒帧数。"

msgid "Shows CPU usage in developer metrics."
msgstr "在开发者指标中显示 CPU 占用。"

msgid "Shows GPU usage in developer metrics."
msgstr "在开发者指标中显示 GPU 占用。"

msgid "Shows device temperature in developer metrics."
msgstr "在开发者指标中显示设备温度。"

msgid "Shows memory usage in developer metrics."
msgstr "在开发者指标中显示内存占用。"

msgid "Shows advanced settings in Galaxy."
msgstr "在 Galaxy 中显示高级设置。"

msgid "Read-only Stinger object validation; no braking or steering changes."
msgstr "只读的 Stinger 目标验证；不改变制动或转向。"

msgid "Serve Galaxy (new) as the default landing page."
msgstr "将 Galaxy（新版）作为默认首页。"

msgid "Uses openpilot longitudinal control; may disable stock AEB."
msgstr "使用 openpilot 纵向控制；可能禁用原厂 AEB。"

msgid "Forces offroad state while parked for remote updates."
msgstr "停车时强制进入停车状态以便远程更新。"

msgid "Matches StarPilot's target speed with Hyundai RES/SET."
msgstr "用现代 RES/SET 对齐 StarPilot 的目标速度。"

msgid "Matches StarPilot's target speed with Subaru Resume/Set."
msgstr "用斯巴鲁 RESUME/SET 对齐 StarPilot 的目标速度。"

msgid "Biases steering toward the detected lane center."
msgstr "将转向偏向检测到的车道中心。"

msgid "Fades lane-centering correction during turn signals."
msgstr "转向灯期间淡出车道居中修正。"

msgid "Hides an acceleration diagnostic; leave off unless testing."
msgstr "隐藏加速诊断；除非测试否则请关闭。"

msgid "Speed & Following"
msgstr "速度与跟车"

msgid "Display & UI"
msgstr "显示与界面"

msgid "Vehicle"
msgstr "车辆"

msgid "Longitudinal"
msgstr "纵向"

msgid "Visual"
msgstr "视觉"

msgid "Actions"
msgstr "动作"

msgid "Safety"
msgstr "安全"

